Dear,
Hi,
I hope  you are doing well.
I read the irace package: User guide  and I have some questions about irace package in R as follows:
1. Is it possible to tune parameters of an algorithm for solving a constrained problem by using irace? or irace just tuning algorithms for solving unconstrained problems.

2. Could you please send for me  an example of tuning the parameters of an algorithm when the algorithm has MATLAB code? How can we write target-runner when we have MATLAB code?

sincerely
Khatere

