I have access to a cluster using HTCondor <https://htcondor.readthedocs.io/en/latest/users-manual/quick-start-guide.html> as job scheduler. Does IRACE support batchmode for HTCondor? If not, would it be possible to adapt one of the example scripts for this scheduler?

